From c9637c59d02d4ba7b1a23311fbfeaf9186cf1a0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:31:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Store door render hex, shape, swatch, and shared exposure.

The admin editor can save a render color, an explicit door shape, and a reference swatch. Audit runs compare a per-style fingerprint of the resolved profile, color, and swatch so a renderer or style change marks older captures stale.

Run docs/sql/0233_door_render_controls.tidb.sql first. Then, from the cabinet-backend repository root:

    git apply /path/to/cabinet-backend-door-render-controls.patch

